# ScribeIntel AI Engine 📝🔐
Advanced Graphology Profiling & Live FastAPI Signature Forensics Platform.

## 🚀 How to Run the Project Locally

### 1. Clone the Repository
```bash
git clone [https://github.com/anvith007/Analysis---02.git](https://github.com/anvith007/Analysis---02.git)
cd Analysis---02



2. Set Up a Virtual Environment
# Create environment
python -m venv venv

# Activate (Windows PowerShell)
.\venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1

# Activate (Mac/Linux)
source venv/bin/activate



3. Install Dependencies
pip install fastapi uvicorn tensorflow opencv-python numpy python-multipart

4. Compile the Model Tensors
python train_models.py

5. Launch the FastAPI Backend Engine
cd backend
uvicorn main:app --reload
The backend API will run live at http://127.0.0.1:8000


